node_modules
.next
.git
.kiro
npm-debug.log
README.md
SERVER_SETUP.md
.env*
# Local-only artifacts that must never enter the build context. Standalone output
# tracing already keeps them out of the runtime image; excluding them here keeps
# the context (and therefore build time) from carrying working copies of source.
.billing-backup-*
.storage
coverage
*.log
# Developer database files. `prisma/` is copied into the runtime image for
# `migrate deploy`, so without this a populated local dev database would be
# baked into a published image alongside the schema it was built from.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
